config MTK_CONNSYS
	tristate "MediaTek CONSYS Wi-Fi/BT/GPS combo controller"
	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on OF
	depends on CFG80211
	help
	  Say Y to enable the driver for the MediaTek CONNSYS combo
	  connectivity subsystem found on the MT6735/MT6737M, MT6750/MT6755
	  and MT6797 SoCs.  Choose M to build it as a module.

	  The driver provides the STP (Serial Transport Protocol) and WMT
	  control stacks plus the character devices the vendor userspace
	  relies on:

	    /dev/wmtdetect  chip detection and stack bring-up
	    /dev/stpwmt     WMT control and MCU firmware loading
	    /dev/stpbt      Bluetooth HCI (STP channel 0)
	    /dev/stpgps     GPS NMEA / MNLD (STP channel 2)
	    /dev/wmtWifi    Wi-Fi power and mode control

	  It also loads the MCU ROM patch and Wi-Fi RAM code firmware
	  (ROMv2_lm_patch*.bin / ROMv3_patch*.bin and WIFI_RAM_CODE_*) from
	  the firmware search path.

	  If unsure, say N.
